  "texts": {
    "preamble": "Pooja Stores vs The Commissioner on 13 June, 2022",
    "facts": "2 . The petitioner is running a provision store. His premises were inspected by the Food Safety Officer, Thuraiyur. A huge quantity of banned and unsafe Tobacco products were allegedly found. Therefore, the second respondent applied to the first respondent for issuance of Emergency Prohibition Notice. Following the said application, the first respondent / the Commissioner passed an order dated 26.04.2022 for sealing the premises in question. As per the Section 34(2) of Food Safety and Standards Act 2006, an Emergency Prohibition Order was issued.",
